acting ability, and outstanding looks have created a large and enthusiastic fan base."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, in their life together, the three of them are completely different people from the one on stage, as they are always at each other's throats, playing with each other, and sometimes spoiling each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, this is the true face of Maria Saotome, which she never shows to anyone except her younger sister, Marimo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12124"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドル声優という枠を超えた日本のトップスター。双子の姉の方。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自信家でプライドが高く高圧的な女性。主人公に対しては、遠慮会釈なく拳の暴力をふるう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今の自分になるために重ねてきた努力の裏打ちがあるからこそ「私はこの世界で神様よりも有名になる」という自信をもっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"派手な外見のため、街を歩けば声をかけられるが、今は自分の夢であるスターへの道が大事なので、男などは眼中にない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナンパ男は軽くあしらいつつも、実は古風な恋愛観をもっているので、男性経験はなし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、オドオドしつつも自分を特別扱いせずに自然に接してくる主人公には興味と好意を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に対しては、他人の前では決して見せない弱い一面も見せるようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12526","sourceWorkId":"13723","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に揺るがない上昇志向を持つ、圧倒的な存在力のオンリーワン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ステージでのパフォーマンス、甘美な歌声、卓越した演技力と抜群のルックスが多くの熱狂的ファンを生んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし3人での生活では、なにかと主人公に対して当り散らしたり、遊び相手にしたり、そして時には甘えたりと、ステージ上とは全くの別人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがそれは本来、妹のまりも以外には見せることの無い、早乙女まりあ本来の顔である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あなた、私の事好きになってもいいわよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44276"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12526","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12526","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12526","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12526","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6c401891ccf69b8e0afced1c52662db94630f981c04e90890761e1b7c9a45bc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4fdee267baaa9955f0bf993584a6e4fa85912dced463516543e49613fab727f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:124097:44276:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12290","characterName":"早乙女 まりも","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44277","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"124097"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12527"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12290"},"originalCharacterName":"早乙女 まりも","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"75"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Twin sister of the Saotome family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In contrast to her older sister, she always has a calm tone. She tends to be a bit tongue-tied."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a novelist and boasts a considerable amount of knowledge, but her lack of real-life experience is a source of worry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She envies Maria, who is able to talk with the main character without hesitation. The topic of breasts is forbidden in front of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12290"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新進気鋭の小説家。双子の妹の方"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メガネの外見通り、おとなしく控えめな性格だが、物語がボケやエロ方向に動こうとする時にはツッコミ役になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に対しては姉と同じく潔癖なところがあり、男性経験はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時に吐く言葉の暴力は、主人公の急所をえぐるような強烈な破壊力で、まりあの拳を凌駕する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が家賃を払うと分かった瞬間に同居をＯＫするなど、金にがめついところがあり、主人公の預金通帳を管理下に収めてホクホクしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貧乳がコンプレックスであり、彼女の胸について発言した者には、容赦なく殺意を抱く。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12527","sourceWorkId":"13723","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"早乙女家の双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉とは対象的に、いつも落ち着いた口調。少々毒舌家な傾向がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小説家であり相当な知識量を誇っているが、その分実体験の少なさが悩みの種。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と屈託無く話し合えているまりあを影ながら羨ましく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の前で胸の話題は禁句。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「かまってくれないと弱ります、衰弱します」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44277"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12527","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12527","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12527","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12527","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d6ac787862d7686f441ed92284c0923a910b4c5c53745139163be9501c0cfb7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c92c2f2a598b7e0f6715dc4e25a0e2175ebe781bb334aa3d769b0d8cb3edba0c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宝井葵","creatorId":"vndb:s3540","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3540","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3540","name":"宝井 葵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:124097:44277:25129:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12291","characterName":"ミライ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44278","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"124097"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12528"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12291"},"originalCharacterName":"ミライ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"107"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"J"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a mature and sexy woman who knows how to be both sweet and sour."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not pleased with the relationship between the main character and Maria, and tries to separate them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her actions are unrestrained and sometimes extend to sexual acts. She is a connoisseur who knows what is going on behind the scenes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12291"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドル「まりあ」の敏腕マネージャー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年でまりあをトップスターにすると豪語して、実行した手腕をもつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女を世に売り出すために主人公からまりあをあらゆる手（主に性的誘惑）を使い引き離そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の天敵。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12528","sourceWorkId":"13723","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"酸いも甘いも知り尽くした大人の色気漂う女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と まりあの関係を快く思っておらず、ふたりを引き離そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その行動は手段を選ばず、時に性的な行為にまで及ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"裏の裏まで読みつくす策士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「どうやってあの娘の事、諦めさせてあげようかしら？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44278"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"107 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12528","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"j","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12528","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12528","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12528","sourceWorkId":"13723","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04f4293c3b979a766c0909be43c37855e669267743f0dd2d0c2ae4a241b216d2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1fe4008ab46460936c66c477b7e6d5c773d4b5814a81609c3eac316305585c17.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水口まつり","creatorId":"vndb:s879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s879","name":"水口 まつり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:124097:44278:6380:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12292","characterName":"るな","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12292"},"originalCharacterName":"るな","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only